              "text": "o passe — \"the travel pass, the season ticket; the pass (in football)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Compro o passe todos os meses. I buy the travel pass every month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "O passe covers buses, trams and the metro for a month."
            }
          ]
